  "_agreement": [
    "actor is singular and takes verb3 (the -s form); actorp is plural and takes verb (the bare",
    "form). Splitting them is the only reason 'Until the Homesteaders Pays' cannot be generated.",
    "A form that mixes them wrong reads as a machine talking, which is the whole thing this file",
    "exists to avoid — see also motion3, which exists because 'Something Forgets to Chalk Section'",
    "is what happens when an arrival template is handed an intransitive verb."
  ],

